%% Sequence diagram UC5: guardrail interaction from the chat UI.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":24,"messageMargin":18,"boxMargin":6,"boxTextMargin":4,"noteMargin":6,"useMaxWidth":true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant UI as Chat UI
    participant API as Chat Stream API
    participant Guard as Guardrail Module
    participant Config as Profile Config
    User->>UI: Send message
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/chat/stream
    API->>Guard: Validate input message
    Guard->>Config: Read guardrail policy
    Config-->>Guard: Rules and safe reply
    alt Input is unsafe
        Guard-->>API: deny + safe response
        API-->>UI: SSE denied event
        UI-->>User: Show safe reply
    else Input is allowed
        Guard-->>API: allow
        API->>Guard: Validate generated output
        alt Output is unsafe
            Guard-->>API: deny + safe response
            API-->>UI: SSE denied event
            UI-->>User: Show safe reply
        else Output is allowed
            Guard-->>API: allow
            API-->>UI: SSE token and done events
            UI-->>User: Stream answer
        end
    end
